        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fad7056c22750f69c6268ddd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动很快就要开始了呢～。\r\n城里的活动……！\r\n要、要准备些什么才好……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7dc5f7a51a49684c7fe5815d1a46afc068cb67cb22c14933f8b5e6e4c36a25e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5a4fd732916fc0e73d21aa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要参加活动了哟！\r\n这让我想起了村里的祭典呢……\r\n大家一起把气氛炒热吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a4a48fa3213317ad732d1e060c690e5367d2875c3d27a1eee38ebaece4e9ccf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1818d388e0c18969d3ee3468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非、非常抱歉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0abb6c8f3767d7fa31534de65ae6fc6ee5f70d94bc2fbf856d67484018d1aa29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c02f139e62291a381c3c20c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级提升了哟？！\r\n啊呀～真厉害啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e5d14b0e803ce9179abba99aa4cf7ef7aa99ffd05ee1fe6e61864b092e6a5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:439fa989b7e044492774455f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このほっこりニット、一目惚れで！\r\nピンクだし、ボタンもでっかくて、\r\nすンげぇ留めやすいンですよ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60d6a500bfbee2241a695766afbb03ed60e3815440227ee3ed9fdfd8e5bdda3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f09533b7fbca9a2a5381f78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上京ン時に持ってけなかった服も、\r\nあとで送ってもらったンですけど…\r\n実家の匂いがして、その…へへ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dcc0692fdfc2eefa27444e9e450519a524aad85538bf1b07763dd49401e1f96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca7f3955b930c7b4c61e7075",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シチーさんに選ンでもらった服…\r\nもったいなくて、飾ったまンまで！\r\n勇気、出すンで…見てほしいですっ",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bac568f69fe92e644afb419fdec0dcf6581d50f60883fdcfb775dfc1054e06a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
